    references are not unconditional spawns; actual effects depend on hit/material/water/damage
    type/ammo and particle rules in Bullet.as/Emitter.as\",\"launch\":{\"appearance\":\"pfeUI:1610\",\"coordinateSpace\":\"weapon-local
