    weapon X/Y; Emitter gilza; not emit (Weapon.as:1568-1572)\",\"poseRule\":\"compose
    owner attachment/aim/facing + weapon visual recoil + frame emit; Weapon.as:1972-2011;
    runtime pose not baked\",\"animationLabels\":[\"shoot\"]},\"ruleSources\":[\"source/rules/fe/weapon/Weapon.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/Bullet.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/PhisBullet.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/SmartBullet.as\",\"source/rules/fe/graph/Emitter.as\"],\"issues\":[]}]},{\"version\":1,\"id\":\"alilight2\",\"definition\":\"weapon:alilight2\",\"evidence\":\"code/resource-derived;
