    symbol pshot_s\",\"label\":null,\"frame\":null,\"metadataXml\":null,\"sheet\":null}],\"ammoDefinitions\":[\"item:scrap\"],\"effects\":[],\"effectResolutionRule\":\"configured
    references are not unconditional spawns; actual effects depend on hit/material/water/damage
    type/ammo and particle rules in Bullet.as/Emitter.as\",\"launch\":{\"appearance\":\"pfeUI:1591\",\"coordinateSpace\":\"weapon-local
