    velocity=(cos(angle),sin(angle))*speed; owner/ammo/state modifiers remain dynamic\",\"source\":\"source/rules/fe/weapon/Weapon.as:1394-1418,1460-1507\",\"socketName\":\"emit\",\"hasAuthoredSocket\":true,\"missingSocketPolicy\":\"explicit
