    symbol plasma_s\",\"label\":null,\"frame\":null,\"metadataXml\":null,\"sheet\":null}],\"ammoDefinitions\":[],\"effects\":[{\"role\":\"impact\",\"sourceId\":\"eclipse\",\"definition\":\"part:eclipse\",\"rule\":\"implicit
    flare=visbul\",\"status\":\"configured-reference\"},{\"role\":\"explosion\",\"sourceId\":\"eclipse\",\"definition\":\"part:eclipse\",\"rule\":\"explicit
    visexpl\",\"status\":\"configured-reference\"}],\"effectResolutionRule\":\"configured
    references are not unconditional spawns; actual effects depend on hit/material/water/damage
    type/ammo and particle rules in Bullet.as/Emitter.as\",\"launch\":{\"appearance\":\"pfeUI:1519\",\"coordinateSpace\":\"weapon-local
    source pixels; x right, y down; independent of PNG zoom\",\"rule\":\"direct child
    emit.x/y transformed through weapon to parent; absent emit uses logical X/Y\",\"directionRule\":\"rot
    - rotUp*facing/50 + shotSpread + (pelletIndex-(pellets-1)/2)*deviation*3.1415/360;
    velocity=(cos(angle),sin(angle))*speed; owner/ammo/state modifiers remain dynamic\",\"source\":\"source/rules/fe/weapon/Weapon.as:1394-1418,1460-1507\",\"socketName\":\"emit\",\"hasAuthoredSocket\":false,\"missingSocketPolicy\":\"explicit
    original logical weapon X/Y; not sprite center; requires owner pose\",\"casingOriginRule\":\"logical
