    references are not unconditional spawns; actual effects depend on hit/material/water/damage
    type/ammo and particle rules in Bullet.as/Emitter.as\",\"launch\":{\"appearance\":\"pfeUI:4130\",\"coordinateSpace\":\"weapon-local
    source pixels; x right, y down; independent of PNG zoom\",\"rule\":\"logical
    weapon X/Y; thrown projectile uses held weapon artwork; mine branch depends on
    throwtip\",\"directionRule\":\"rot + spread + getRot(target,power,getVel(...));
    contextual throwing rule\",\"source\":\"source/rules/fe/weapon/WThrow.as:177-192\",\"socketName\":\"emit\",\"hasAuthoredSocket\":false,\"missingSocketPolicy\":\"explicit
    original logical weapon X/Y; not sprite center; requires owner pose\",\"casingOriginRule\":\"logical
    weapon X/Y; Emitter gilza; not emit (Weapon.as:1568-1572)\",\"poseRule\":\"compose
    owner attachment/aim/facing + weapon visual recoil + frame emit; Weapon.as:1972-2011;
    runtime pose not baked\",\"animationLabels\":[]},\"ruleSources\":[\"source/rules/fe/weapon/Weapon.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/WThrow.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/Bullet.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/PhisBullet.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/SmartBullet.as\",\"source/rules/fe/graph/Emitter.as\"],\"issues\":[]}]},{\"version\":1,\"id\":\"mine\",\"definition\":\"weapon:mine\",\"evidence\":\"code/resource-derived;
