    runtime pose not baked\",\"animationLabels\":[]},\"ruleSources\":[\"source/rules/fe/weapon/Weapon.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/WClub.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/Bullet.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/PhisBullet.as\",\"source/rules/fe/weapon/SmartBullet.as\",\"source/rules/fe/graph/Emitter.as\"],\"issues\":[]},{\"grade\":1,\"parameters\":{\"grade\":1,\"behavior\":\"WClub\",\"evidence\":\"code-derived;
    XML parameter overlay; runtime unverified; not final owner-modified statistics\",\"rawXml\":\"<weapon
    id=\\\"mspear\\\" tip=\\\"1\\\" mtip=\\\"1\\\" cat=\\\"1\\\" skill=\\\"1\\\"
    lvl=\\\"5\\\"><char maxhp=\\\"350\\\" damage=\\\"37\\\" rapid=\\\"10\\\" tipdam=\\\"6\\\"
    knock=\\\"5\\\" destroy=\\\"300\\\" combo=\\\"1\\\" /><char maxhp=\\\"400\\\"
    damage=\\\"41\\\" rapid=\\\"10\\\" destroy=\\\"500\\\" /><phis massa=\\\"1\\\"
    m=\\\"3\\\" long=\\\"25\\\" /><vis tipdec=\\\"15\\\" lasm=\\\"1\\\" flare=\\\"plasma\\\"
    /><vis tipdec=\\\"16\\\" flare=\\\"plasma1\\\" /><snd shoot=\\\"m_med\\\" fall=\\\"fall_metal_item\\\"
    flare=\\\"plasma\\\" noise=\\\"400\\\" /><sats cons=\\\"18\\\" /><com price=\\\"4500\\\"
    worth=\\\"5\\\" chance=\\\"0.1\\\" stage=\\\"3\\\" rep=\\\"0.12\\\" uniq=\\\"0\\\"
