    symbol mine_bip\",\"label\":null,\"frame\":null,\"metadataXml\":null,\"sheet\":null}],\"ammoDefinitions\":[],\"effects\":[],\"effectResolutionRule\":\"configured
    references are not unconditional spawns; actual effects depend on hit/material/water/damage
    type/ammo and particle rules in Bullet.as/Emitter.as\",\"launch\":{\"appearance\":\"pfeUI:4106\",\"coordinateSpace\":\"weapon-local
    source pixels; x right, y down; independent of PNG zoom\",\"rule\":\"place Mine
    at logical X/Y; collision placement may move to owner position; no muzzle-fired
    projectile\",\"directionRule\":\"mine placement; mass, sensor, timer, damage
    and visual state use Mine constructor's base definition rules\",\"source\":\"source/rules/fe/weapon/WThrow.as:143-169;
    source/rules/fe/unit/Mine.as\",\"socketName\":\"emit\",\"hasAuthoredSocket\":false,\"missingSocketPolicy\":\"explicit
    original logical weapon X/Y; not sprite center; requires owner pose\",\"casingOriginRule\":\"logical
